WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.073
Clear instructions use action verbs and logical steps. Polite requests include

00:00:05.073 --> 00:00:07.731
respectful words and a realistic response.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:13.077
Which greeting suits a visitor in the afternoon? Answer: Good afternoon; welcome.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.067
Tell a partner how to prepare a reading notebook and ask for help politely.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.043
Why it works: The greeting matches the time and occasion.
